  "title": "Ex 9.11 · Is a + b < ab for natural numbers?",
  "prompt": "Statement: for all natural numbers $a$ and $b$, $a + b < ab$. This statement is false. Disprove it with a counterexample.",
  "answer_format": "Integer values for every variable, like a = 4, b = 2, c = 2.",
