  "answer": "a = 1, b = 1",
  "mistakes": [],
  "hints": [
    "Natural numbers start at 1 in this book.",
    "Try the smallest values."
  ],
  "solution": [
    "Take $a = b = 1$: $a + b = 2$ but $ab = 1$, and $2 < 1$ is false.",
    "So the statement is false."
  ],
